OL,3,ABeach homes face demolition months
OL,4,Aafter being sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA property investor and a woman
OL,7,Fplanning for her retirement have been
OL,8,Ftold their homes are at risk of falling
OL,9,Finto the sea just months after they
OL,10,Fpurchased them.
OL,12,FThe two properties are part of a
OL,13,Fcollection of former fishermen's
OL,14,Fcottages in the hamlet of Newport,
OL,15,Fsouth of Hemsby, Norfolk.
OL,17,FThe houses, which were both bought in
OL,18,Fthe last three months, are among nine
OL,19,Fproperties in the area deemed to be at
OL,20,Frisk of coastal erosion.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
